I changed `lateCharge` so the first four started steps cost the usual 1200p each and every step after the fourth costs 2400p, with the `LATE_CAP_PENCE` cap still applied to the total. I added a small constant, `LATE_FULL_PRICE_STEPS = 4`, next to the other late constants. I wasn't unsure of anything; I took "step" to mean each started 30-minute step, as the function counts them now.
